1d:["$","figure",null,{"className":"page-visual page-visual--inline","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/application-writing-1280.webp","srcSet":"/images/application-writing-640.webp 640w, /images/application-writing-1280.webp 1280w","sizes":"(max-width: 860px) calc(100vw - 32px), 440px","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":"Illustrative student writing application notes beside a laptop","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":"Illustrative editorial image; not a photograph identifying a particular university."}]]}]
1e:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Use the university’s process, not a generic appointment rule",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Use the university’s process, not a generic appointment rule"}],[["$","p","METU’s current Ankara instructions illustrate the university-handover route: students complete e-İkamet and deliver files to its International Students Office on the prescribed schedule, instead of independently attending an assigned migration appointment unless instructed. That is a METU procedure, not a national Thursday rule.",{"children":"METU’s current Ankara instructions illustrate the university-handover route: students complete e-İkamet and deliver files to its International Students Office on the prescribed schedule, instead of independently attending an assigned migration appointment unless instructed. That is a METU procedure, not a national Thursday rule."}],["$","p","Ask your own office how it applies the protocol. Save the completed PDF promptly, retain submission evidence and watch the university contact channel for missing-document requests. A form saved online does not by itself confirm that a complete file has reached the authority.",{"children":"Ask your own office how it applies the protocol. Save the completed PDF promptly, retain submission evidence and watch the university contact channel for missing-document requests. A form saved online does not by itself confirm that a complete file has reached the authority."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://iso.metu.edu.tr/en/node/32",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://iso.metu.edu.tr/en/node/32","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"METU: student residence workflow and institutional scope"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Organise identity, student status and address evidence",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Organise identity, student status and address evidence"}],[["$","p","Build the file from the current list applicable to you. Typical categories are the completed form, passport/entry evidence, biometric photograph, active student record, payment evidence, address and insurance. Minors and particular applicant histories can require additional documents.",{"children":"Build the file from the current list applicable to you. Typical categories are the completed form, passport/entry evidence, biometric photograph, active student record, payment evidence, address and insurance. Minors and particular applicant histories can require additional documents."}],["$","p","Use evidence of the place you actually live. A dorm allocation and the later residence-address document are different records. Ask what the dorm must issue; for rented housing, establish which contract and authentication format will be accepted before committing to the property.",{"children":"Use evidence of the place you actually live. A dorm allocation and the later residence-address document are different records. Ask what the dorm must issue; for rented housing, establish which contract and authentication format will be accepted before committing to the property."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Organise identity, student status and address evidence","children":["$L22"]}]]}],"$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27"]}]
